f="/encyclopedia/ecgfrith-of-northumbria">Ecgfrith of Northumbria</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-dun-nechtain">Dun Nechtain</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">717</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nechtan-mac-der-ilei">Nechtan son of Der-Ilei</a> expels the clergy of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iona">Iona</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">741</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oengus-i-of-the-picts">Óengus son of Fergus</a> carries out the 'smiting' of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dal-riata">Dál Riata</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">839</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vikings">Vikings</a> kill King <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eoganan-mac-oengusa">Eóganán</a> and many Pictish nobles</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">c. 843</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kenneth-macalpin">Cináed mac Ailpín</a> becomes king of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/picts">Picts</a></span></li></ol>
